<p>Hits the target with your weapon, doing <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">43%, 48%, 53%, 56%, 60%</acronym> damage. If the attack hits, the target is stunned for <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">3, 4, 5, 6, 7</acronym> turns and has their bleed resistance reduced by 50%.</p><p>The stun chance increases with your Physical Power.</p><p></p><p><span style="font-style: italic"><span class="tstr-font-italic">It may not bleed, exactly, but you'll make it hurt.</span></span></p>